cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Freiburg Brain Immune Data Viewer"
abstract: >-
  A pipeline that converts collections of Seurat objects into cloud-optimised
  AnnData-Zarr stores and generates a static Vitessce viewer over them, so
  published single-cell and spatial datasets can be browsed without a backend
  server.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/rsankowski/Freiburg-Brain-Immune-Data-Viewer"
authors:
